# Component Migration Patterns

## Form Components
- Replace `<input>` with `<Input>` from shadcn/ui
- Replace `<textarea>` with `<Textarea>` from shadcn/ui
- Replace `<select>` with `<Select>` from shadcn/ui
- Replace `<button>` with `<Button>` from shadcn/ui
- Use `<Label>` for form labels

## Layout Components
- Replace custom container divs with `<Card>` from shadcn/ui
- Use `<CardHeader>`, `<CardContent>`, `<CardFooter>` for structured layouts
- Apply consistent padding with Tailwind classes: `p-4`, `p-6`, `p-8`

## Table Components
- Replace custom `<table>` with shadcn/ui `<Table>` components
- Use `<TableHeader>`, `<TableBody>`, `<TableRow>`, `<TableCell>`
- Apply responsive design with Tailwind breakpoint classes

## Navigation
- Replace `NavLink` from react-router with Next.js `Link`
- Use `usePathname()` hook for active state detection
- Apply Tailwind classes for navigation styling: `hover:bg-gray-100`, `active:bg-blue-500`

## Styling Conversion
- Convert SCSS classes to Tailwind utilities
- Use semantic color classes: `text-gray-900`, `bg-white`, `border-gray-200`
- Apply consistent spacing: `space-y-4`, `gap-4`, `p-4`
- Use responsive prefixes: `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`, `xl:`
